t 80 across the network doesn't work.\r\n2. Ephemeral nodes don't seem to expire properly. I have a node that is marked online (when it's not, it had been offline for +1 hour), expired is \"yes\", and the `expired_at` field continuously increments by 5 seconds every 5 seconds, so the node never goes away from the list in `headscale nodes list`, nor from `tailscale status`.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/comments/1933300332/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"dustinblackman","id":5246169,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDYxNjk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5246169?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dustinblackman","html_url":"https://github.com/dustinblackman","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dustinblackman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dustinblackman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dustinblackman/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dustinblackman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dustinblackman/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dustinblackman/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dustinblackman/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dustinblackman/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dustinblackman/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":11740315933,"node_id":"MEE_lADOEFLz8859YnhqzwAAAAK7xwEd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/events/11740315933","actor":{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://ap