c237a6dc83d8d2e2c61a6695e5dd434dab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/bfaa4bc237a6dc83d8d2e2c61a6695e5dd434dab"},"message":"Replace database calls with transactions\n\nThis commits removes the locks used to guard data integrity for the\ndatabase and replaces them with Transactions, turns out that SQL had\na way to deal with this all along.\n\nThis reduces the complexity we had with multiple locks that might stack\nor recurse (database, nofitifer, mapper). All notifications and state\nupdates are now triggered _after_ a database change.\n\nSigned-off-by: Kristoffer Dalby <kristoffer@dalby.cc>\n\nwops\n\nSigned-off-by: Kristoffer Dalby <kristoffer@tailscale.com>","parents":[{"sha":"cbf57e27a78922c88edd8de8f02c99810a653786","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/cbf57e27a78922c88edd8de8f02c99810a653786","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/cbf57e27a78922c88edd8de8f02c99810a653786"}],"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAAGgAAAATZWNkc2Etc2hhMi1uaXN0cDI1NgAAAAhuaXN0cDI1NgAAAE\nEE6bT6+U8pNExCb214X9sKtM8QMSqzWb4HmQxm24sqHasMtgza7Cws+M2NoiUVB+RSfa/I\nCoai/Io5VHtD9nbzKgAAAANnaXQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAGQAAAATZWNkc2Etc2hhMi\n1uaXN0cDI1NgAAAEkAAAAhAKVslLULbT3ayC9m1Q5g4lqX2kZu8nE3ZMIlAfeOtGPOAAAA\nIEdI9Fuo+RogP976w4T2g9ntd6AYicp+mFiA4udqgW0W\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","payload":"tree bfaa4bc237a6dc83d8d2e2c61a6695e5dd434dab\nparent cbf57e27a78922c88edd8de8f02c99810a653786\nauthor Kristoffer Dalby <kristoffer@dalby.cc> 1704390843 +0000\ncommitter Kristoffer Dalby <kristoffer@tailscale.com> 1707405973 +0100\n\nReplace database calls with transactions\n\nThis commits removes the locks used to guard data integrity for the\ndatabase and replaces them with Transactions, turns out that SQL had\na way to deal with this all along.\n\nThis reduces the complexity we had with multiple locks that might stack\nor recurse (database, nofitifer, mapper). All notifications and state\nupdates are now triggered _after_ a database change.\n\nSigned-off-by: Kristoffer Dalby <kristoffer@dalby.cc>\n\nwops\n\nSigned-off-by: Kristoffer Dalby <kristoffer@tailscale.com>\n","verified_at":"2024-11-08T21:46:34Z"},"event":"committed"},{"id":11747445438,"node_id":"HRFPE_lADOEFLz8859YnhqzwAAAAK8M8q-","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/events/11747445438","actor":{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"head_ref_force_pushed","commit_id":"0d773b09aa3f5bf6f55b2a858bfa0428f6f29f97","commit_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kradalby/headscale/commits/0d773b09aa3f5bf6f55b2a858bfa0428f6f29f97","created_at":"2024-02-08T15:26:33Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/comments/1934376684","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/1701#issuecomment-1934376684","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/1701","id":1934376684,"node_id":"IC_kwDOEFLz885zTD7s","user":{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"h